{"unit_id":"Imnotndesh__dsh-peak-pricing-warning#card-zh","repo":"Imnotndesh/dsh-peak-pricing-warning","commit":"866cf5c07c7fc3ca92cf349d0f657625520fa586","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Peak Pricing Warning 是一款 DSH 网页插件，在对话输入框模型选择器旁显示 DeepSeek 价格状态。Host 根据 UTC 工作日时段计算高峰或非高峰状态，网页徽标显示状态和切换倒计时；它还按会话 token 用量与内置费率估算费用。适合希望查看 DeepSeek 计价时段及会话费用估算的 DSH 网页用户，无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-8","plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:104-155","plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:502-615"]}
