{"unit_id":"Imnotndesh__dsh-peak-pricing-warning#feature-1","repo":"Imnotndesh/dsh-peak-pricing-warning","commit":"866cf5c07c7fc3ca92cf349d0f657625520fa586","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Peak Pricing Warning 的功能「价格状态徽标」：在对话输入框模型选择器旁展示 DeepSeek 当前处于高峰、工作日非高峰或周末非高峰时段，并且只在当前模型识别为 DeepSeek 时显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:252-260","plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:502-523","plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:612-615"]}
