{"unit_id":"Imnotndesh__dsh-peak-pricing-warning#feature-3","repo":"Imnotndesh/dsh-peak-pricing-warning","commit":"866cf5c07c7fc3ca92cf349d0f657625520fa586","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Peak Pricing Warning 的功能「会话费用估算」：读取会话 tokenUsage 中的缓存读取、缓存写入、未缓存输入和输出数量，套用对应模型的费率并按当前高峰状态计算估算金额。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/peak-pricing-warning/src/plugin.js:557-584"]}
